# 1. VM Installation
- Install vmware. 
- Create two virtual machines (windows server 2022, windows 10)


# 1. Setup ethernet connection
- Open cmd and type ipconfig and enter.
- Open run > ncpa.cpl > ipv4 properties > fill the ip addresses.


# 2. Add active directory
- Open server manager
- click on add roles and features
- select active directory and install


# 3. Test connection between server and client.
- Change security group inbound and allow "All ICMP"
- Ping server from client and vice-versa


# 4. Add windows client machine to domain
- Open client machine cmd.

```
> sysdm.cpl
```
